      "seed": 126402,
      "subject": "Subject: one tiny swamp detail, each image a different one of these: three round mud bubbles of different sizes #6a6440 rising, one bursting; a grey heron #a8b0b8 standing on one thin leg; a few white fluffy tufts of bog cotton on short green stems; a small olive swamp turtle #6e7a3a with a dark shell; an old mossy animal skull #d8ceb0 half hidden in a tuft of reeds. Small and low, about half of the image wide, much smaller than a person.",
      "negative": "ground patch, water patch, puddle, shadow, person, gold, coins, gem, chest, jar, pot, plate"
